<title>UK: City Mortgage Receivables sets 116 mln stg FRN.</title>
<headline>City Mortgage Receivables sets 116 mln stg FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>City Mortgage Receivables 3 Plc has issued a two-tranche mortgage-backed FRN maturing in October 2023, it said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Class A notes total 96.54 million stg, and class B notes total 19.77 million stg. The issue price on both is par.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
